---
export const prerender = true;
---

<html lang="es">
    <head>
        <meta charset="utf-8" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
        <title>Página en Mantenimiento | Mintaka Group</title>
        <meta name="description" content="Estamos realizando mejoras en nuestro sitio. Volveremos pronto." />
    </head>
    <body>
        <main class="maintenance">
            <div class="maintenance__content">
                <div class="maintenance__icon-wrapper">
                    <img 
                        src="/construccion.png" 
                        alt="Página en mantenimiento" 
                        class="maintenance__img" 
                    />
                </div>
                
                <h1 class="maintenance__title">Sitio en Mantenimiento</h1>
                
                <p class="maintenance__text">
                    Estamos realizando mejoras para ofrecerle una mejor experiencia.
                    <span class="maintenance__text--sub">Nuestro equipo está trabajando para volver lo antes posible.</span>
                </p>

                <div class="maintenance__timer">
                    <span class="dot"></span>
                    <span class="dot"></span>
                    <span class="dot"></span>
                </div>
                
                <a href="/" class="maintenance__button">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
                    </svg>
                    Volver al Inicio
                </a>

                <div class="maintenance__footer">
                    <p>Si necesita asistencia inmediata, contáctenos:</p>
                    <a href="mailto:info@mintakagroup.com" class="maintenance__contact">info@mintakagroup.com</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </main>

        <style>
            :global(html, body) { 
                height: 100%;
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
            }
            
            body {
                font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
                background: #0f172a;
                color: #ffffff;
                overflow: hidden;
            }

            .maintenance {
                min-height: 100vh;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                padding: 2rem;
                position: relative;
                background: 
                    radial-gradient(ellipse at top, rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%),
                    radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom, rgba(251, 146, 60, 0.05) 0%, transparent 50%);
            }

            .maintenance::before {
                content: "";
                position: absolute;
                top: 0;
                left: 0;
                right: 0;
                bottom: 0;
                background-image: 
                    linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
                    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
                background-size: 50px 50px;
                pointer-events: none;
            }

            .maintenance__content {
                position: relative;
                z-index: 1;
                text-align: center;
                max-width: 560px;
                animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out;
            }

            .maintenance__icon-wrapper {
                margin-bottom: 2rem;
                animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
            }

            .maintenance__img {
                width: 100%;
                max-width: clamp(120px, 30vw, 200px);
                height: auto;
                display: block;
                margin: 0 auto;
                filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 25px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.3));
                opacity: 0.95;
            }

            .maintenance__title {
                font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 2.25rem);
                font-weight: 700;
                margin: 0 0 1rem;
                line-height: 1.2;
                letter-spacing: -0.025em;
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #f97316 100%);
                -webkit-background-clip: text;
                -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
                background-clip: text;
                animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out 0.2s backwards;
            }

            .maintenance__text {
                font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.8vw, 1.125rem);
                line-height: 1.7;
                margin: 0 0 1rem;
                color: #cbd5e1;
                animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out 0.4s backwards;
            }

            .maintenance__text--sub {
                display: block;
                margin-top: 0.5rem;
                font-size: 0.9em;
                color: #94a3b8;
            }

            .maintenance__timer {
                display: flex;
                gap: 0.75rem;
                justify-content: center;
                margin-bottom: 2rem;
                animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out 0.6s backwards;
            }

            .dot {
                width: 10px;
                height: 10px;
                background: #f97316;
                border-radius: 50%;
                animation: pulse 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;
                box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.5);
            }

            .dot:nth-child(2) {
                animation-delay: 0.3s;
            }

            .dot:nth-child(3) {
                animation-delay: 0.6s;
            }

            .maintenance__button {
                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 0.5rem;
                padding: 0.875rem 1.75rem;
                font-size: 0.95rem;
                font-weight: 600;
                color: #ffffff;
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f97316 0%, #fb923c 100%);
                border: none;
                border-radius: 8px;
                cursor: pointer;
                transition: all 0.3s ease;
                box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.4);
                animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out 0.8s backwards;
                text-decoration: none;
            }

            .maintenance__button:hover {
                transform: translateY(-2px);
                box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.5);
            }

            .maintenance__button:active {
                transform: translateY(0);
            }

            .maintenance__button svg {
                transition: transform 0.3s ease;
            }

            .maintenance__button:hover svg {
                transform: translateX(-3px);
            }

            .maintenance__footer {
                margin-top: 3rem;
                padding-top: 2rem;
                border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
                animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out 1s backwards;
            }

            .maintenance__footer p {
                font-size: 0.875rem;
                color: #94a3b8;
                margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
            }

            .maintenance__contact {
                color: #f97316;
                text-decoration: none;
                font-weight: 500;
                transition: color 0.3s ease;
            }

            .maintenance__contact:hover {
                color: #fb923c;
                text-decoration: underline;
            }

            @keyframes fadeInUp {
                from {
                    opacity: 0;
                    transform: translateY(30px);
                }
                to {
                    opacity: 1;
                    transform: translateY(0);
                }
            }

            @keyframes float {
                0%, 100% {
                    transform: translateY(0px);
                }
                50% {
                    transform: translateY(-15px);
                }
            }

            @keyframes pulse {
                0%, 100% {
                    opacity: 0.4;
                    transform: scale(0.9);
                }
                50% {
                    opacity: 1;
                    transform: scale(1.1);
                }
            }

            @media (max-width: 640px) {
                .maintenance {
                    padding: 1.5rem;
                }

                .maintenance__footer {
                    margin-top: 2rem;
                    padding-top: 1.5rem;
                }
            }
        </style>
    </body>
</html>